<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Freud returns six weeks after intake. He smokes about six cigars a day and has chosen a quit date one week from today. The quitline has called him three times. The nausea stopped once he took varenicline after food, and the dreams are milder. The relined obturator seals better: liquids leak into his nose only now and then, and his speech is clearer. The sore spot had healed by the two-week check at the prosthodontics clinic. Dr. Vasquez-Lindqvist took impressions for the new obturator last week. The speech-language therapy sessions have not started because the first appointment was cancelled. His pain is 4 of 10 and he is eating more. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cigars</td><td>About six a day; quit date one week from today</td></tr><tr><td>Varenicline</td><td>1 mg twice daily after food; no nausea; milder dreams</td></tr><tr><td>Quitline</td><td>Three calls</td></tr><tr><td>Pain</td><td>4 of 10</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>58.9 kg</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
